WEBVTT

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:30.060
Learn from us.

00:11:30.602 --> 00:11:32.604
Try to understand,

00:11:32.646 --> 00:11:35.858
respect and heed Indigenous guardianship.

00:11:36.191 --> 00:11:39.528
Or else, like me,

00:11:39.528 --> 00:11:42.489
the next great wind will blow us all over.

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:44.408
Thank you.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:50.080
(Cheers and applause)